why: Kirill asked, on the third finding at this block, what the coined set name the block used was at all; a term neither the code nor ordinary English gives is written as what it is in the words of the code's own condition, and where the act prevents a state the act leads, verb-first, with the fact as its reason Rescored 2026-09-29 under §94: subject and phrasing keeps dropped, so its column no longer compares.
