--- code
export function newBookNarrowing(currency: string): BookNarrowing {
  return {
    keepsBook: (book) => !isPostingBook(book) || book.postings.some((posting) => declaresCurrency(posting, currency)),
    keepsPosting: (posting, book) => !isPostingBook(book) || declaresCurrency(posting, currency),
  };
}
--- facts
How a ledger treats an empty posting book is unknown, since every catalogued export gives each book a posting.
So this function drops a fallback posting book whole instead of letting the narrowing remove each of its postings.
